id: SCA-027
title: Git attributes filter/smudge/clean commands
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: .gitattributes
  exclude_paths: .git/
patterns:
  - regex: filter\s*=
    message: Git filter driver executes commands on checkout/stage — can run arbitrary code whenever files are processed.
  - regex: smudge\s*=
    message: Git smudge filter executes on checkout — can inject malicious content into working directory files.
  - regex: clean\s*=
    message: Git clean filter executes on stage — can exfiltrate file contents or modify staged data.
fix: Audit all filter definitions in .gitattributes and .git/config. Remove any that execute scripts or binaries you did not write.
